  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Given Symbol Meanings:**\n\n× → −\n\n− → +\n\n/ → ×\n\n+ → ÷\n\n**Option 1:** 18 - 6 + 3 × 2\n\nReplace symbols:\n\n18 + 6 ÷ 3 − 2\n\n6 ÷ 3 = 2\n\n18 + 2 − 2 = 18\n\n≠ 27 \n\n**Option 2:** 36 / 6 - 3 + 2 × 1\n\nReplace symbols:\n\n36 × 6 + 3 ÷ 2 − 1\n\n36 × 6 = 216\n\n3 ÷ 2 = 1.5\n\n216 + 1.5 − 1 = 216.5\n\n≠ 20 \n\n**Option 3: 16 / 2 + 4 - 1 × 3**\n\n**Replace symbols:**\n\n**16 × 2 ÷ 4 + 1 − 3**\n\n**16 × 2 = 32\n\n32 ÷ 4 = 8\n\n8 + 1 − 3 = 6**\n\n**= 6 **\n\n**Option 4:** 12 × 4 - 2 + 1\n\nReplace symbols:\n\n12 − 4 + 2 ÷ 1\n\n12 − 4 = 8\n\n2 ÷ 1 = 2\n\n8 + 2 = 10\n\n≠ 19 \n\n**Hence, the correct option is Option 3**",
